.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, B3LYP-D3BJ/def2-SVP. Optimisation and frequencies. This calculation shows the diene of the Diels-Alder reaction in its s-gauche conformation, the reactant geometry used here, with an electronic energy of -155.776738 Eh. With ethylene it is the reactant side of the reaction energy profile.
